@startuml sequence-1oo1-single
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #01579B
    ActorBackgroundColor #E1F5FE
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #E1F5FE
    ParticipantBorderColor #01579B
}

participant "RBC Application" as app
participant "RTE Framework" as sapi
participant "IPC" as ipc
participant "Output" as output

autonumber

app ->> app: receive_signal(X)
note right of app: Single input received

app ->> sapi: process_signal(X)
note right of sapi: Single-threaded processing

sapi ->> sapi: compute_result()
note right of sapi: No voting needed\nNo redundancy\nSingle path

sapi ->> ipc: send_output(result)

ipc ->> output: transmit()
note right of output: Direct output\nNo synchronization

output ->> output: execute()
note right of output: Action taken immediately

note over app, output
  Single System (1oo1):
  - No redundancy
  - No fault tolerance
  - Single point of failure
  - Fast (no voting overhead)
  - Suitable: SIL 1/2, development
end note

@enduml
